\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/969076-what-if-helios-moon-and-gaia-lied-from-the-beginning?p=971141#post971141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're not talking about a single entity.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yes, we are. Computers are composed of a bunch of tinier, individual parts, and yet there are computer spirits. City spirits are made up of people, animals, trash, treasure, artifice, elements, death and ghostly ancestors and more, and yet the cities have distinct, individual spirits ruling over them. The planet as a whole is no different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T12:51:47-07:00","id":971473,"title":"","content":"I kind of always felt that Gaia was a holdover from Classic. And since the game was moving away from eco terrorists / Captain Planet. and more towards local spirits ecosystems (which is a move I've always loved dearly) Saving the world is a fantasy for the initial themes of a desperate losing war setting. Forsaken has pretty much left the major spirits in the hands of the gm, to work as he needs.<br /> <br /> Personally I find the linking of the Sun and Moon a perfectly good idea. In lots of Mythologies The Sun and Moon are linked. In Greek Roman they were siblings. And from a RL perspective the Moon's Light is just the Sunlight reflected during the night. I mean you could literally make them primordial light spirits that evolved parallel down different paths. Helios The path of Flesh. Luna the path of Spirit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Placeholder","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11731-mercset","name":"MercSet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11731_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"277"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T13:01:29-07:00","id":971482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enokh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/969076-what-if-helios-moon-and-gaia-lied-from-the-beginning?p=970739#post970739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ohhhhh MAN there are so many cool ways to spin out a related, similar theory. I wouldn't use yours in my games but good lord is it fun!<br /> <br /> Could be kinda neat to spin it as part of this unending cycle -- once upon a time, the Idigram were tearing it up, got locked inside a prison made of a small celestial body by Alien!Wolf. Eventually, the Idigram escaped for whatever reason, and after completely ruining everything (and killing Alien!Helios/nova-ing the local star) they hopped inside their former prison and hurled themselves out into the stars. . slamming into a young planet, which created the moon that would be their prison, and then later their method of escape. . so on and so forth forever.</div> </div> </div> </div>And the Cycle continues, They're cosmic spirit viruses! Replacing the Spirit DNA with their Retro RNA strands","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Placeholder","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11731-mercset","name":"MercSet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11731_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"277"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T20:16:53-07:00","id":971709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MercSet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/969076-what-if-helios-moon-and-gaia-lied-from-the-beginning?p=971482#post971482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And the Cycle continues, They're cosmic spirit viruses! Replacing the Spirit DNA with their Retro RNA strands</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be absolutely terrifying, too, if the creatures that locked them away finally came after them. Might tie in with Mage, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/av